<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="10">
<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1002Q_S000F" variety="S000F">
<name>Navigation</name>
<ttl id="1002Q_S000F_746OU_T00CJ" variety="T00CJ">
<name>HDD Navigation System</name>
<para id="RM000001M5N00YX" category="J" type-id="801HS" name-id="652MG-00" from="200612" to="200912">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>Noise from all speakers in all modes</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000001M5N00YX_01" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000AEG00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When replacing the navigation receiver assembly on a vehicle not subscribed to the G-BOOK service, perform the vehicle linking setting. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001C3S00RX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When replacing the navigation receiver assembly on a vehicle subscribed to the G-BOOK service, perform the vehicle linking setting, then perform the G-BOOK use resumption operation and HELPNET service start operation. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000001C3S00RX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If the navigation receiver assembly is replaced while a purchased G-SOUND unlimited license exists, perform G-SOUND license recovery. (see <xref label="Seep03" href="RM000001C3S00RX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000001M5N00YX_02" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000001M5N00YX_02_0007" proc-id="RM0550J___0000AEI00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Speaker Installation Condition</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Inspect Speaker Installation Condition</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Inspect each speaker installation for looseness, play or other abnormalities.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Inspect each speaker for foreign matter inside or for abnormalities such as a torn speaker cone.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.99in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.14in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Speakers normal</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Speaker improperly installed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Foreign matter in speaker</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Speaker cone torn</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>D</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001M5N00YX_02_0001" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM000001M5N00YX_02_0003" fin="true">B</right>
<right ref="RM000001M5N00YX_02_0004" fin="true">C</right>
<right ref="RM000001M5N00YX_02_0005" fin="true">D</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001M5N00YX_02_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000AEH00000">
<testtitle>Identify Cause of Noise</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Identify the cause of the noise based on the symptom chart below.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>First, check that there is no external noise. If this step is neglected, the source of the noise may be unclear and misidentified, so always perform it.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When eliminating noise, eliminate the strongest noise first and proceed in order.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Detuning the radio (not tuned to a broadcast) makes the noise more noticeable and the symptom easier to judge.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
<table pgwide="1">
<title>Symptom Chart</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="4.50in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.58in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Cause of Noise</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A whining sound rises in pitch when the accelerator is depressed, and disappears immediately when the engine is stopped</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Alternator noise</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A hissing sound is heard when the A/C or heater is operating</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Blower motor noise</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A creaking sound is heard when accelerating suddenly while driving on an unpaved road or with the ignition ON</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Fuel pump noise</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A click is heard when the horn button is pressed and released, and a buzzing sound while it is held</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Horn noise</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A faint sound (popping, hissing) stops when the engine is stopped</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Ignition noise</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A clicking sound occurs in time with the turn signal flasher</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Flasher noise</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Noise occurs while the windshield washer is operating</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Washer noise</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A creaking sound occurs while the engine is running and continues after the engine is stopped</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Water temperature sensor noise</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A scraping sound is heard along the line where the wiper contacts</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Wiper noise</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A crackling sound is heard when the brake pedal is depressed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Stop light switch noise</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Others</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Static electricity accumulated in the vehicle</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.99in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.14in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Cause of noise cannot be identified</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Cause of noise can be identified</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001M5N00YX_02_0002" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM000001M5N00YX_02_0006" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001M5N00YX_02_0002">
<testtitle>Replace Navigation Receiver Assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001XG4006X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001M5N00YX_02_0003">
<testtitle>Install speaker correctly</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001M5N00YX_02_0004">
<testtitle>Remove foreign matter from speaker</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001M5N00YX_02_0005">
<testtitle>Replace applicable part</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001M5N00YX_02_0006">
<testtitle>Noise filter at the relevant location</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
